# OhGithubLost v6.0.1

内置加速通道换新代理 + 架构决策：Web 端完全独立成支。
New acceleration proxy for the built-in channel, plus an architecture decision: Web moves to its own branch.

## 架构决策 / Architecture
- **Web 端完全独立**：独立分支 `web` + 独立 `lib/` + 独立 workflows。
  - **不共用代码**：web 端不复用 main 的 `lib/`；
  - **不共用 actions**：web 端不跑 `build.yml` / `ci.yml`；
  - **允许反复失败**：web 失败**不影响** main 的五平台构建与发布。
  > Web lives on its own branch with its own `lib/` and its own workflows — no shared
  > code, no shared actions, and it may fail as often as it needs without ever
  > affecting the five-platform release.
- **平台能力下沉为原生实现**（下一阶段）：原先由 action 里的 `inject_*.py`
  改平台工程的做法，改为**原生 Dart 实现**，action 退化为**可选编译**开关。
  Platform capabilities move from action-time injection to native Dart implementations;
  actions degrade to opt-in compile switches.

## 变更 / Changed
- **内置加速通道改走 `gh.felicity.ac.cn` 转发完整 GitHub 链接**：优先前缀由
  `https://gh.344977.xyz/` 改为 `https://gh.felicity.ac.cn/https://github.com/`；
  `https://gh.felicity.ac.cn/` 保留为降级备选，仍按序探测并静默降级，
  最后永远保留直连兜底。
  The built-in channel now forwards the full GitHub link through
  `gh.felicity.ac.cn`; the bare host stays as a silent-fallback option.
- 更新日志站（`changed/`）全部 Release 下载链接改为同一形式。
  All changelog-site download links now use the same form.

## 移除 / Removed
- **实验性 Web（wasm）构建管线从 main 移除**：Web 改由独立分支承接。
  The experimental Web (wasm) pipeline is removed from main; Web moves to its own branch.
